{"repositoryId":1309115507,"availability":"available","full":"RS-Arafath/BookBridge","name":"BookBridge","description":"A full-stack book borrowing platform built with Next.js, using Server Components for fast pages and a client-side BorrowButton with toast notifications. Styled with HeroUI & Tailwind CSS, backed by a Render API, deployed on Vercel.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":6,"forks":1,"created":"2026-07-22T18:05:16Z","updated":"2026-07-31T13:29:44Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://book-bridge-kappa.vercel.app","topics":["full-stack","heroui","javascript","library-management","lucide-react","mern-stack","nextjs","react","react-hot-toast","responsive-web-design","tailwindcss","userfriendly","vercel"],"demo":"https://book-bridge-kappa.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:36.871Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:36.871Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:36.871Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T00:57:36.871Z","stars":6,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A modern book borrowing platform where readers can explore a curated library, check book details, and borrow their next favorite read — all in a clean, fast, Next.js-powered experience.","BookBridge is a full-stack Next.js application built as a digital library — readers can browse a growing collection of books across genres, view detailed pages for each title, and borrow a book in a single click. The homepage walks new visitors through a featured-books carousel, the full collection, a \"How It Works\" borrowing guide, and reader testimonials, while authenticated users get a personal profile space.","This project was built to strengthen real-world Next.js App Router skills — including server components, authenticated routes, third-party auth (Google OAuth via Better Auth), MongoDB data modeling, and building a consistent design system on top of HeroUI."],"features":["🏠 Landing Experience — Hero section, auto-rotating marquee banner, featured books carousel, and a 4-step \"How It Works\" guide for new users","📚 Book Catalog — Browse the full collection on /allBooks, with dedicated detail pages per book (/featureBooks/[id], /featurePhoto/[id])","🔄 One-Click Borrowing — A dedicated BorrowButton client component handles the borrow action with instant react-hot-toast feedback, without needing to make the whole page a client component","🔐 Authentication — Secure sign-in with Google OAuth, powered by Better Auth and its official MongoDB adapter","👤 Profile Page — Session-aware profile route for logged-in users"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RS-Arafath/BookBridge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"58f87e0c9b6924fc0a3adca15a5f28082f28b15742687b9ce5d41d3f46754a9c","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:36.980Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:36.980Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A modern book borrowing platform where readers can explore a curated library, check book details, and borrow their next favorite read — all in a clean, fast, Next.js-powered experience.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RS-Arafath/BookBridge/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"🔐 Authentication — Secure sign-in with Google OAuth, powered by Better Auth and its official MongoDB adapter","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RS-Arafath/BookBridge/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Wiring up Better Auth with the MongoDB adapter for Google sign-in required careful environment configuration (client ID/secret, base URL, trusted origins) to work correctly both locally and on Vercel's production domain.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RS-Arafath/BookBridge/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"58f87e0c9b6924fc0a3adca15a5f28082f28b15742687b9ce5d41d3f46754a9c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RS-Arafath/BookBridge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T00:57:36.980